dsh-theme-nier-automata README · Using Rodin：Manrope is the OFL stand-in. If you own Fontworks Rodin, drop it in:

```css
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Rodin';
  src: url('/path/to/Rodin.woff2') format('woff2');
  font-weight: 300 700;

Then override `--dsw-font-family` to `'Rodin', 'Manrope', sans-serif`.

